| description = Create a swarm of razorflies that transform an enemy into an irresistible floating beacon, attracting witless comrades before exploding on command.
| strength = 200 / 250 / 300 / 350 ({{D|Heat}} damage per sec)<br>1,000 / 1,500 / 2,000 / 2,500 ({{D|Heat}} damage on explosion)
| duration = 10 / 15 / 20 / 25 s (duration)
| range = 15 / 20 / 25 / 25 m (cast range)<br>8 / 12 / 15 / 20 m (attract radius)<br>5 / 6 / 7 / 8 m (explosion radius)<br>2.5 m (damage radius)
