| cardonly = {{{1|}}}
| info = *Titania expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''75''' [[energy]] to infuse an enemy with mesmerising light from up to {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''15 / 20 / 25 / 25''' meters away, causing it to hover in place with a swarm of razorflies. The Lantern source becomes [[Invulnerable]] and unable to move or attack for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''10 / 15 / 20 / 25''' seconds. Enemies that come within {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''8 / 12 / 15 / 20''' meters from the Lantern will be pacified and blindly follow the target. Enemies within {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''2.5''' meters of the Lantern will be dealt {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''200 / 250 / 300 / 350''' {{D|Heat}} damage every second. Titania can have up to <u>'''4'''</u> Lanterns active at once.
**Charm and heat damage aura do '''not''' require line of sight to target enemies.
**Cast animation of '''1.3''' seconds is affected by [[Casting Speed]].
**All damage prevented by the invulnerable enemy target are stored and dealt in full when the ability ends.
*Upon deactivation by holding the ability key (default {{Keybind|3}}), expiration or being dispelled, all active Lanterns will explode, dealing {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''1,000 / 1,500 / 2,000 / 2,500''' {{D|Heat}} damage to the source enemies and all enemies within {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''5 / 6 / 7 / 8''' meters.
**Requires line of sight to damage enemies.
**Damage diminishes with distance.
*If the target dies before Titania finishes her casting animation, energy used for Lantern will be refunded.
*Enemies trapped by Lantern become allied to the player, which means {{E|Arbitration Shield Drone}}s '''cannot''' dispel it.
*Trapped enemies '''do''' count toward mission progression (e.g. [[Defense]]). They must be slain to progress, deactivate all lanterns by holding down the ability key.
